  "machines": 3,
  "setup": "3 Sparks on ConnectX-7 RoCE (pairwise triangle), SSH key from head to both workers, pip install pexpect on head, host NCCL 2.30.7 at $HOME/nccl-2.30.7 mounted at /nccl. ./start.sh download (hf download at HF_REVISION) + sync (rsync ~272 GB to workers) + pull (docker save/rsync/load image to workers) + ray (Ray head container on head, Ray worker containers on workers via ssh, each `bash -lc 'cd /opt/vllm && source .venv/bin/activate && ray start ...'`) + serve (docker exec vllm serve inside Ray head container, log /tmp/vllm-serve.log). Disable earlyoom on all nodes.",
